          "semanticAnchorId": "ANCHOR__BACFBE4A_3",
          "title": "3. Key Academic Principles: The Universal Law of Gravitation, Gravitational Constant",
          "contentMarkdown": "Universal Gravitational Constant (G): G is a universal scalar constant determined experimentally by Henry Cavendish using a torsion balance.",
